<title>USA: Standard Federal takeover approved.</title>
<headline>Standard Federal takeover approved.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard Federal Bancorp said Thursday its shareholders, at a special meeting, approved the proposed acquisition of the company by ABN AMRO North America Inc, a unit of ABN AMRO Holding NV.</p>
<p>Terms call for each Standard Federal common share to be exchanged for $59 in cash. All required regulatory approvals for the transaction with ABN AMRO have been received, and the transaction is expected to be completed by May 1.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
